<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{{event.title}}</title>
    <style>
    h1 {text-align: center; font-family: sans-serif;}
    h2 {text-align: center; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 90%;}
    p,li { font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 90%; }
    table, th, td {
        border: 2px solid black;
        border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    #table{
        max-width: 2480px;
        width:100%;
    }
    #table td{
        width: auto;
        overflow: hidden;
        word-wrap: break-word;
        vertical-align: top;
    }
    </style>
    <style type="text/css">
        @page {    size: 21cm 29.7cm; margin: 10mm 20mm 10mm 20mm; }
        
    </style>
</head>
<body>
{% for ticket in tickets %}
<table border=0 style="width:100%;border: 0px solid black;">
    <tr>
        <td style="border: 0px solid black;"><img height="75" src="https://repaircafegosport.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/RCG-logo-300x106-1.png"></td>
        <td style="border: 0px solid black"><h1>Repair Form</h1><h2>{{date}}</h2>
    </tr>
</table>
<h2>Item Description ({{ticket["Reference"]}})</h2>
<p>Please fill in this form for one item, if there are multiple items, a second form should be used</p></td>
<table border=0 style="width:100%">
    <tr style="height:70px">
        <td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top"><p>Item for Repair (Including Brand and Model if known): {{ticket['Broken Thing']}}</p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="height:100px">
        <td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top"><p>Description of the Fault:{{ticket['Fault Description']}}</p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><p>Weight (KG):</p></td>
        <td><p>Age of Item:</p></td>
    </tr>
</table>
<h2>Safety Inspection (Electrical Only)</h2>
<table border=0 style="width:100%">
    <tr>
        <td colspan="3"><p>Initial Check:</p></td>
        <td><p>Class: </p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><p>Visual: Pass / Fail </p></td>
        <td><p>Earth Continuity: </p></td>
        <td><p>Insulation Resitance: </p></td>
        <td><p>Leakage: </p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td colspan="4"><p>Comments: </p></td>
    <tr>
        <td colspan="4"><p>Final Check (Signed for Pass):</p></td>
    </tr>
</table>
<h2>Repair</h2>
<table border=0 style="width:100%">
    <tr style="height:100px">
        <td colspan="2" style="width:100%; vertical-align: top"><p>Desription of Repair:</p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="width:50%"><p>Repairer:</p></td>
        <td style="width:50%"><p>Outcome: Fixed / Repairable / End of Life</p></td>
    </tr>
</table>
<h2>Guest Feedback</h2>
<table border=0 style="width:100%">
    <tr style="height:50px">
        <td><p>Visitor Comments:</p></td>
    </tr>
</table>
<h2>Thank you</h2>
<p>Repair Cafe Gosport is run by volunteers and relies on donations to for costs. It costs approx. £170 to run each month, if each guest who can afford to donate gave at least £10 we can carry on doing this. Thank You in advance for visiting </p>
<div style="break-after:page"></div>
<h1>Guest Information ({{ticket["Reference"]}})</h1>
<table border=0 style="width:100%">
    <tr>
        <td><p>Name: {{ticket['Full Name']}}</p></td>
        <td><p>Phone: {{ticket['Phone Number']}}</p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><p>Email:{{ticket['Order Email']}}</p></td>
        <td><p>Postcode:{{ticket['Post Code'].upper()}}</p></td>
    </tr>
</table>
<h2>Disclaimer</h2>
<p>
<ol>
<li><b>Registration:</b> All visitors must complete a registration form before any advice or repair. This is for our records and future contact about your visit or events. One form covers one item (or agreed similar items); additional items need separate forms.</li>
<li><b>Photos & Video:</b> Photos and videos may be taken for non-profit promotion. If you prefer not to appear, please inform a volunteer.</li>
<li><b>Demand & Availability:</b> We aim to help everyone, but may limit visitors to one item at busy times and cannot guarantee assistance.</li>
<li><b>Pre-booking:</b> Booking helps reduce congestion but does not guarantee a repair at a specific time. The order of help may vary.</li>
<li><b>Risk & Liability:</b> All advice and repairs are given in good faith but at your own risk. Repair Café Gosport and its volunteers accept no liability for damage, loss, or injury—including to personal property (such as vehicles or belongings)—during your visit, or from repairs or advice (including later use).</li>
<li><b>No Guarantees:</b> We do not guarantee that repairs will be successful, safe long-term, or that items will work afterwards.</li>
<li><b>Parts & Materials:</b> Visitors must provide any required consumables (e.g. leads, plugs, fuses, zips).</li>
<li><b>Right to Refuse:</b> Volunteers may refuse or stop a repair or advice at any time without explanation.</li>
<li><b>Incomplete Repairs:</b> Repairs may not be finished, and items may not be reassembled. You must take items away in their current state.</li>
<li><b>Safety:</b> Tools and equipment may be dangerous. Parents/guardians are responsible for supervising children.</li>
<li><b>Electrical Safety:</b> All electrical items must be safety tested after repair. If an item fails and is deemed unsafe, you give permission for us to disable it—this will typically involve removing or cutting off the plug to prevent use.</li>
<li><b>Stay With Your Item:</b> You must stay with your item during repair to observe and learn. Items cannot be left or collected later. All items must be taken home, repaired or not.</li>
</ol>
</p>
<p>I have read, understood and agreed to abide by the house rules/disclaimer.</p>
<table border=0 style="width:100%">
    <tr>
        <td style="width:80%"><p>Signed:</p></td>
        <td style="width:20%"><p>Date:</p></td>
    </tr>
</table>
{% if not loop.last %}
<div style="break-after:page"></div>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %} {# the main ticket loop #}
</body>
</html>